      // ── IDEAS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
      h1("The Ideas"),
      spacer(60),

      ideaCard("01",
        "AI-Powered CNC Machinery Valuation Service",
        "The 'Kelley Blue Book' for used industrial machinery — powered by AI.",
        "Sell standalone machine valuations to manufacturers, plant managers, estate attorneys, banks, and private equity firms who need accurate fair market value on CNC and heavy industrial equipment. Right now, this is manual, slow, and expensive. TJ's combination of appraisal experience + AI can deliver faster, data-backed reports at a fraction of competitor pricing — or at premium pricing with faster turnaround.",
        "Train an AI model on historical sale prices, machine age/hours/condition data, OEM specs, and current market listings. AI generates a draft valuation report with comps; TJ reviews and signs. Output is a professional branded PDF with market analysis. Tools: ChatGPT API for report writing, custom pricing database, PDF generation. As the database grows, accuracy improves and manual review time shrinks.",
        "$500–$2,500 per report depending on machine type and urgency. Banks, PE firms, and attorneys need these regularly. 20 reports/month at an average of $1,200 = $24K/month. Can scale without adding headcount.",
        "Low-Medium. TJ already does appraisals — this is productizing and AI-accelerating what he already knows. Needs a report template, pricing database, and simple intake form.",
        "30–60 days to first paying client."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      ideaCard("02",
        "Industrial Equipment Condition Intelligence Platform",
        "Sell insight, not just machinery — AI-graded machine health reports with every sale.",
        "Every machine Opincar lists gets an AI-assisted condition report: hours, maintenance history, known issues, part availability index, expected remaining lifespan, and refurbishment cost estimate. Buyers pay more for certainty. Dealers and manufacturers pay for peace of mind. This differentiates every listing and creates a premium tier of 'Certified Opincar' inventory.",
        "AI vision analysis of uploaded machine photos flags wear patterns, damage, and corrosion. AI text generation writes the condition narrative from TJ's inspection notes. Integrate with listing on Machinio, eBay, and the Opincar website. Over time, build a proprietary condition scoring system that becomes a brand asset.",
        "10–15% price premium on 'Certified' machines — directly adds margin to existing sales. Optionally sell standalone condition reports to third parties: $300–$800 each. Potential to license the scoring system to other dealers: $500–$2,000/month.",
        "Low. Builds directly onto the existing sales process. No new business to launch — just a system to build around what TJ already does on every machine.",
        "2–4 weeks to implement on first listings."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      ideaCard("03",
        "Manufacturing Plant Decommission & AI Asset Inventory Service",
        "When factories close or restructure, someone has to catalog everything. Make that TJ.",
        "When a plant shuts down, gets acquired, or undergoes a major restructuring, they need a complete, accurate inventory of every piece of machinery for insurance, sale, tax, or legal purposes. Opincar goes on-site, photographs and logs every asset, and uses AI to auto-identify equipment from photos, auto-populate spec sheets, and generate a complete asset manifest. This is a high-value, high-trust service where TJ's knowledge is irreplaceable.",
        "Use AI image recognition (Google Vision API or custom model) to identify machine make, model, and approximate age from photos. AI cross-references against OEM databases to pull specs automatically. Final deliverable is a complete digital asset register with photos, specs, estimated values, and recommended disposition (sell, refurbish, scrap). TJ's team executes; AI does the cataloging grunt work.",
        "$5,000–$25,000 per engagement depending on plant size. PE firms, bankruptcy trustees, and large manufacturers are the buyers — they have budget and urgency. Even 2 engagements per month = $10K–$50K. Strong upsell into purchasing the equipment being cataloged.",
        "Medium. Requires a solid on-site process, mobile photo workflow, and AI identification pipeline. The upsell into purchasing the inventory is where the real money is.",
        "60–90 days to first engagement."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      ideaCard("04",
        "CNC Machinery Sourcing Subscription for Manufacturers",
        "Become the 'scout' on retainer — AI-monitored market watching for buyers.",
        "Manufacturers and machine shops are always looking for specific equipment but rarely have time to monitor the fragmented used machinery market constantly. Offer a monthly subscription where TJ (with AI assistance) actively scouts for specific machines on a client's wish list — monitoring auctions, dealer networks, and listings — and sends curated alerts when matches appear. When TJ sources the machine, he earns a finder's fee.",
        "AI scrapes and monitors Machinio, IronPlanet, Ritchie Bros., eBay Industrial, and private dealer networks for matching inventory. Clients submit specs; AI matches and alerts. TJ reviews before sending — keeping quality high. Automated weekly market reports show clients what's available and trending in their equipment categories.",
        "Subscription: $500–$1,500/month per client. Finder's fee on successful purchases: 3–8% of transaction value. 15 subscription clients = $7.5K–$22.5K/month recurring + deal fees. Very high margin, minimal overhead once the monitoring system is built.",
        "Low-Medium. Monitoring automation is buildable with existing no-code tools. The relationships to fill the subscription spots are already in TJ's network.",
        "45–60 days to launch with first 5 clients."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      ideaCard("05",
        "AI-Enhanced Rigging & Relocation Estimating Tool",
        "Faster, more accurate rigging quotes — licensed to other dealers and riggers nationally.",
        "Rigging quotes on heavy CNC machinery are notoriously slow, manual, and inconsistent. Build an AI-powered estimating tool that takes machine specs, photos of the installation site, and destination details — and generates a detailed rigging cost estimate in minutes. Use it internally first to win more rigging work. Then license it to other machinery dealers and rigging companies who face the same problem.",
        "AI analyzes machine weight, dimensions, disassembly requirements, floor loading specs, and access constraints from photos and inputs. Generates itemized estimate with labor, equipment, and transport costs. Integrates with Google Maps for distance-based freight calculation. The tool improves with every completed job as actual vs. estimated costs feed back in.",
        "Internal use: win more rigging contracts faster, reduce quote-to-close time significantly. License to other dealers: $299–$999/month SaaS. 30 licensed users = $9K–$30K/month pure software revenue. Highly scalable — no incremental cost per user.",
        "High. Building the estimating tool requires real development investment. However, internal use alone justifies the build, and licensing is pure upside. Best pursued once cash flow from simpler ideas is established.",
        "6–12 months to full product. Internal ROI in 3–4 months."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      ideaCard("06",
        "Industrial Machinery Auction Intelligence & Advisory",
        "Help buyers win the right machines at the right prices at IronPlanet, Ritchie Bros. and beyond.",
        "Industrial machinery auctions at IronPlanet, Ritchie Bros., Hilco, and similar platforms are complex, fast-moving, and full of information asymmetry. Manufacturers and smaller shops often overpay or miss great buys because they lack real-time intelligence. TJ offers an advisory service where AI pre-screens upcoming auctions, flags relevant lots, estimates fair value, and advises clients on bidding strategy. TJ provides the expert judgment; AI provides the data speed.",
        "AI monitors upcoming auction catalogs, auto-identifies relevant lots based on client watchlists, pulls comparable sales data, and generates pre-auction intelligence briefings. Machine learning on historical auction results refines value estimates over time. Deliver weekly briefings and real-time alerts during live auctions. Upsell into acting as buyer's agent on a commission basis.",
        "Advisory subscription: $1,000–$3,000/month. Buyer's agent commission: 3–6% of purchase price. A single successful $200K auction purchase at 4% commission = $8,000. 10 advisory clients + 2–3 auction assists/month = $15K–$30K+/month.",
        "Medium. Requires auction monitoring automation and a strong client communication process. TJ's auction knowledge is the core value — AI just makes it faster and more scalable.",
        "45–75 days to first paying advisory client."
      ),
      spacer(200),

      // ── PRIORITY MATRIX ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
      h1("Priority Comparison"),
      spacer(60),
      matrixTable([
        ["AI Valuation Service",           "$$$  High",       "★★★★☆",  "Low-Med",  "30–60 days"],
        ["Condition Intelligence",         "$$ Med-High",     "★★★★☆",  "Low",      "2–4 weeks"],
        ["Plant Decommission Service",     "$$$$  Very High", "★★★☆☆",  "Medium",   "60–90 days"],
        ["Sourcing Subscription",          "$$$  High",       "★★★★★",  "Low-Med",  "45–60 days"],
        ["Rigging Estimator (SaaS)",       "$$$$  Very High", "★★★★★",  "High",     "6–12 months"],
        ["Auction Intelligence Advisory",  "$$$  High",       "★★★★☆",  "Medium",   "45–75 days"],
      ]),
      spacer(200),

      // ── RECOMMENDED STACK ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
      h1("Recommended Launch Stack"),
      body("Rather than picking one idea and hoping for the best, TJ is positioned to run these in sequence — each one builds toward the next and shares the same underlying asset: AI-powered market intelligence about heavy industrial machinery."),
      spacer(60),

      new Table({
        width: { size: 9360, type: WidthType.DXA },
        columnWidths: [1400, 3280, 4680],
        rows: [
          new TableRow({ children: [
            headerCell("Phase", 1400),
            headerCell("Move", 3280),
            headerCell("Why Now", 4680)
          ]}),
          ...[
            ["Phase 1\n(0–60 days)", "Launch AI Valuation + Condition Intelligence", "Both bolt directly onto existing appraisal and sales work. No new business needed. Just a system and a product sheet."],
            ["Phase 2\n(60–120 days)", "Launch Sourcing Subscription + Auction Advisory", "Use the valuation database you've started building as the intelligence layer for both. Existing clients are the first subscribers."],
            ["Phase 3\n(4–9 months)", "Launch Plant Decommission Service", "Market yourself through the relationships developed in phases 1–2. PE and bankruptcy referrals come naturally once you're known as the intelligence operator."],
            ["Phase 4\n(9–18 months)", "Build and License the Rigging Estimator", "By now you have cash flow, a data asset, and a proven track record. The SaaS play becomes fundable or bootstrappable with real confidence."],
          ].map((r, idx) =>
            new TableRow({ children: r.map((c, i) =>
              cell(
                [para([run(c, { size: 19, color: DARK, bold: i === 0 })])],
                [1400, 3280, 4680][i],
                idx % 2 === 0 ? LIGHTER_STEEL : WHITE,
                { top: border(), bottom: border(), left: noBorder(), right: noBorder() }
              )
            )})
          )
        ]
      }),
      spacer(200),

      // ── CLOSE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
      h1("The Big Picture"),
      body("The industrial machinery market is still years behind consumer markets in AI adoption. Most dealers are still running the same processes they were using in 2010. TJ has an extraordinary window right now to be the first operator in this space who is genuinely AI-powered — not as a gimmick, but as a real operational advantage that delivers faster quotes, better valuations, smarter sourcing, and a superior buyer experience."),
      spacer(60),
      body("None of these ideas require TJ to become a tech company. They require TJ to stay exactly what he is — the most knowledgeable heavy CNC machinery dealer in the region — and let AI handle the speed, the data, and the scale that no single person could otherwise manage."),
      spacer(200),

      bannerBox(
        "The machines don't change. The intelligence around them does.",
        "Prepared exclusively for TJ Opincar  ·  Opincar Machinery, Smyrna TN  ·  February 2026"
      ),
    ]
  }]
});

Packer.toBuffer(doc).then(buf => {
