      ["Trade Publications", "Advertise in Modern Machine Shop, Manufacturing Engineering, or Fabricating & Metalworking. A small classified or quarter-page ad runs $200–$800/issue. These are read by the exact decision-makers TJ needs. One deal pays for a year of ads."],
