          sp(60),
          p([r("Why they need TJ:",{bold:true,size:19,color:STEEL})],{spacing:{before:0,after:40}}),
          p([r("Regional bank commercial lenders need equipment values when underwriting new equipment loans, renewing existing credit facilities, or handling distressed borrowers. Many lack access to a fast, specialized industrial equipment appraiser. TJ fills that gap for the entire bank\u2019s commercial lending team.",{size:19,color:DARK})]),
        ],[
