          ]}),
          ...[
            ["Monday\n(30 min)","Research 5 new prospects using LinkedIn, SFNet directory, or ABL Advisor. Add name, title, company, LinkedIn URL, and phone to prospect spreadsheet. Note any context (recent deal announcements, industry they serve, etc.)"],
            ["Tuesday\n(45 min)","Write and mail 5 physical letters using the letter template. Address each one personally. Include the one-page capability sheet as an enclosure. Batch printing and mailing on Tuesdays keeps this from becoming a random task."],
            ["Wednesday\n(45 min)","Make phone follow-up calls to anyone who received a letter 5\u20137 days ago. Goal: reach 2\u20133 people live. Leave voicemails for the rest. Log every call outcome in the spreadsheet."],
            ["Thursday\n(30 min)","Send 5\u20138 LinkedIn messages to new prospects who have not yet received a physical letter. Personal, short, no pitch \u2014 just open a conversation. Connect with anyone who accepts the invite."],
            ["Friday\n(20 min)","Review the week: how many new contacts made, how many sample report offers extended, any paid engagements confirmed. Update the spreadsheet. Plan next week\u2019s 5 new research targets."],
            ["Monthly\n(60 min)","Send the Opincar Market Intelligence email to all active lender contacts (anyone who has engaged or done business). One page, 3\u20135 bullet points on CNC machinery market activity. Keeps TJ visible without being pushy."],
          ].map(([when,what],i) => new TableRow({children:[
