      sp(50),
      p([r("A manufacturer is closing. Restructuring. Selling a division. Moving overseas. The facility needs to be emptied. Every machine, every piece of tooling, every forklift, every shelf of raw material has to be identified, cataloged, and valued before anything can be sold, donated, auctioned, or scrapped. Right now, that job usually falls to an overwhelmed facilities manager who has never done it before, or to a generalist auctioneer who will catalog what they can and liquidate the rest at a fraction of value. TJ Opincar can do this job faster, more accurately, and with significantly better value outcomes \u2014 and he gets paid to do it, then offered first right of purchase on anything in his wheelhouse.", { size: 20, color: DARK })]),
    ], LT_RUST, { top: sb(RUST, 4), bottom: sb(RUST, 4), left: sb(RUST, 4), right: sb(RUST, 4) },
    { top: 160, bottom: 160, left: 240, right: 240 }),

    sp(100),

    // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    divider(RED),
    sectionHead("PART 1:  THE FULL OPPORTUNITY \u2014 WHY THIS IS A MAJOR REVENUE SOURCE", RED),
    sp(80),

    p([r("Most equipment dealers have never thought of plant decommissioning as a service line. They wait for someone to call and offer machines. TJ can be in the building months before that call ever happens \u2014 paid to catalog the assets, then positioned as the natural first buyer. Here is the complete picture.", { size: 20, color: DARK })]),
    sp(80),

    new Table({
      width: { size: 9360, type: WidthType.DXA }, columnWidths: [3120, 3120, 3120],
      rows: [new TableRow({ children: [
        ...[
          ["REVENUE LAYER 1", "The Engagement Fee", "TJ is hired and paid to perform the decommission and asset inventory. Fee: $5,000\u2013$25,000 depending on facility size and asset complexity. This is earned income before a single machine is bought or sold.", RED, LT_RED],
          ["REVENUE LAYER 2", "First Right to Purchase Inventory", "Having cataloged every asset, TJ has a complete picture of what is on the floor and what each piece is worth. He is positioned to make first offers on any machinery in his category at favorable pricing before it goes to auction.", GREEN, LT_GRN],
          ["REVENUE LAYER 3", "Resale Margin on Purchased Inventory", "Machines bought at decommission pricing (typically 40\u201360% below FMV) go directly into Opincar inventory. Each one sold at market price generates the standard dealer margin on top of the engagement fee.", NAVY, LT_BLUE],
        ].map(([tag, title, body, accent, fill]) => new TableCell({
          shading: { fill, type: ShadingType.CLEAR }, borders: none,
          margins: { top: 140, bottom: 140, left: 180, right: 180 }, width: { size: 3120, type: WidthType.DXA },
          children: [
            p([r(tag, { bold: true, size: 17, color: accent })], { alignment: AlignmentType.CENTER }),
            p([r(title, { bold: true, size: 21, color: DARK })], { alignment: AlignmentType.CENTER, spacing: { before: 40, after: 80 } }),
            p([r(body, { size: 19, color: DARK })]),
          ]
        }))
